WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:18.313
Brad: I understand why they call a tall building a skyscraper!

2
00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:21.176
Brad: I can’t even see the top of this one.

3
00:00:21.196 --> 00:00:25.940
Danny: Everything is so gray, you almost can’t see anything.

4
00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:32.013
Tina: So how do we find Hopian?

5
00:00:32.353 --> 00:00:33.073
Danny: I don’t know.

6
00:00:33.093 --> 00:00:38.297
Brad: You mean, we came all this way, and you don’t know how to find him?

7
00:00:38.317 --> 00:00:41.419
Danny: I thought he’d be waiting for us.

8
00:00:41.439 --> 00:00:43.661
Tina: Well, he’s not.

9
00:00:43.681 --> 00:00:46.583
Danny: I’m sure we’ll figure something out.

10
00:00:47.323 --> 00:00:48.224
Brad: Look!

11
00:00:48.584 --> 00:00:49.885
Do you see what I see?

12
00:00:49.925 --> 00:00:52.287
Tina: I’m not sure.

13
00:00:52.307 --> 00:00:54.248
Brad: It’s a giant!

14
00:00:54.809 --> 00:00:55.890
Near that car.

15
00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:57.351
Danny: I see him!

16
00:01:03.308 --> 00:01:05.069
Tina: Let’s go over and talk to him!

17
00:01:05.089 --> 00:01:06.750
Brad: Yeah!

18
00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:08.931
Maybe he knows where Hopian is.

19
00:01:08.951 --> 00:01:13.954
Danny: Hi.

20
00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:15.415
My name is Danny.

21
00:01:16.636 --> 00:01:19.698
We’re um we’re looking for a friend.

22
00:01:19.718 --> 00:01:22.199
Danny: He’s a giant like you.

23
00:01:22.219 --> 00:01:26.501
Tina: His name is Hopian.

24
00:01:26.622 --> 00:01:28.543
Brad: Do you know him?

25
00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:39.640
Tina: Oh no!

26
00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:39.860
Don’t cry.

27
00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:42.202
Danny: Did we say something bad?

28
00:01:42.222 --> 00:01:45.404
Brad: I think he was hoping for red paint.

29
00:01:45.424 --> 00:01:47.546
Tina: It’s okay, Mr.

30
00:01:47.606 --> 00:01:50.227
Giant. Just tell us where Hopian is.

31
00:01:59.874 --> 00:02:04.797
Remember, Hopian said that without color [n3@all the giants were getting sad.

32
00:02:04.817 --> 00:02:08.320
Brad: Well, I don’t think he’s going to be much help.

33
00:02:09.356 --> 00:02:11.197
Tina: I think we should leave him alone.

34
00:02:11.217 --> 00:02:19.103
Brad: What is it?

35
00:02:19.123 --> 00:02:21.304
Tina: I don’t know.

36
00:02:21.324 --> 00:02:23.566
I had a funny feeling.

37
00:02:23.586 --> 00:02:28.029
Danny: Well, something funny would be nice right now.

38
00:02:28.049 --> 00:02:29.610
Tina: Look!

39
00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:33.092
That’s not funny, but it sure is weird.

40
00:02:33.132 --> 00:02:35.233
Danny: What’s so weird?

41
00:02:35.253 --> 00:02:38.976
Tina: I see something red.

42
00:02:40.336 --> 00:02:42.237
Brad: Maybe it means we should stop.

43
00:02:44.757 --> 00:02:48.458
Tina: It just became a stop sign!

44
00:02:48.478 --> 00:02:50.559
Danny: Can it hear us?

45
00:02:51.779 --> 00:02:52.819
Brad: Let’s find out.

46
00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:54.660
Can you hear us?

47
00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:59.381
Tina: It can!

48
00:02:59.401 --> 00:03:01.202
Do you know Hopian?

49
00:03:08.144 --> 00:03:08.804
It does!

50
00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:11.743
Brad: Can you take us to Hopian?

51
00:03:12.784 --> 00:03:17.010
Danny: What does that mean?

52
00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:20.254
Tina: I think it means we’re supposed to follow it.

53
00:03:20.915 --> 00:03:27.163
Danny: I told you this wouldn’t be difficult.
